{
 "_doc": [
  "Manifest for render_kind.py. One entry per sprite kind (7 jobs, 20 monsters). `source` is a glb/gltf under",
  "source_root (D:, not in git). `show`/`hide` are regexes over mesh names (KayKit packs bundle every weapon;",
  "pick one). `clips` maps our actions to the model's clip names; an object form adds `hit` (0..1 contact moment",
  "of the attack clip, warped onto frame 3 of 6 = 60 %), `span` [a, b] (part of the clip) and `yaw`.",
  "`tint` multiplies the texture (recolours a shared model into another role), `frame` overrides the default",
  "frame size, `zoom` scales the figure, `floor` drops the lowest rest vertex to the ground, `hover` lifts it.",
  "`folder` is the output dir under client/assets/anim/ (docs/naming.md original monster names; the key stays the engine id).",
  "Licences: see `licenses.json` next to this file; every source here is CC0.",
  "Quaternius's atlas is a muted palette: those kinds get brightness 1.35 and a tint above 1.0 on the hue they should read as (tints multiply before the cel ramp, values over 1 lighten).",
  "Chibi: `bone_scales` scales pose bones (head, hands); `face` puts an anime face decal (gen_faces.py style) on the `target` mesh, parented to `bone`; `squash` bounces blobs in idle/walk; `outline_rel`, `specular`, `rim` shape the ink and the cel look.",
  "`dirs` 8 draws all 8 directions (no mirrored rows, the weapon stays in the right hand); 5 draws S..N and the client mirrors 5..7."
 ],
 "source_root": "D:/jaxspike-art/src",
